        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova Leza wa-Israyeli, Mbubonya mbuli inkuyu ezi imbotu, mbubonya obo mbubabede mumeso aangu bantu ba-Juda batolwa mubuzike, mbendakagwisya kuzwa okuno akubatuma kunyika yaba-Kasidi kuti bajane coolwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.5",
