                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele mbuboobu Jehova mbwaamba aankuyu imbi zitakonzyi kuligwa nkaambo kabubi bwazyo. Mbubonya obo mbubayooba kulindime Zedekiya mwami wa-Juda abasilutwe bakwe abantu bacisyeede mu-Jerusalemu abaabo bacisyeede munyika ino abaabo bakede munyika ya-Egepita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
